			"Message": "docs(Vine): Expand README with comprehensive architecture documentation\n\nSignificantly expand the Vine README from the streamlined format, adding:\n- Core architecture principles table (Contract-First, Type Safety, Transport Agnosticism, Health Awareness)\n- System architecture diagram (Mermaid graph showing Mountain, Cocoon, Grove communication)\n- Protocol structure section with directory layout\n- Deep dive & component breakdown for Mountain and Cocoon\n- Getting started guide with Rust dependencies and planned usage\n- Development status table tracking features (Proto Definitions, gRPC Services, etc.)\n- Changelog reference section\n- Expanded funding & acknowledgements with NLnet project details\n\nThis provides comprehensive documentation for the gRPC protocol layer while clearly indicating current implementation status across the Land ecosystem.",
